'''Jamie Cat''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Street Fighter Collaboration Event]]. It is a variant of [[Kung Fu Cat (Special Cat)|Drunken Master Cat]]. He was added in [[Version 14.7 Update|Version 14.7]] for [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]] and [[Version 15.0 Update|Version 15.0]] for [[The Battle Cats|BCEN]].

